WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.926
The leaky bucket says brand health drains.

00:00:02.976 --> 00:00:04.955
The bucket holds today's buyers.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:05.805
Natural loss and trend pressure leak them out.

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:09.946
A refill means new buyers.

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:12.647
Allen's lollies look healthy today.

00:00:12.697 --> 00:00:17.127
But older fans drift away, and health trends pull younger ones off too.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:18.633
So Allen's refills the bucket.

00:00:18.246 --> 00:00:25.263
A playground, not a museum: intense flavours and wild textures for Gen Z.

00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:28.794
Even a strong brand has to keep recruiting new buyers,

00:00:28.844 --> 00:00:31.349
or it slowly runs dry.
